        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 18.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nimuve i Babuloni, muhunge muve mu Bakaludaya muvuge ibi, mubibwirize mubyamamaze bigere ku mpera y'isi, mubivugishe ijwi ry'indirimbo muti “Uwiteka acunguye umugaragu we Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ubwo yabajyaga imbere mu butayu ntibarakicwa n'inyota, yabatembeshereje amazi ava mu gitare, kandi yāshije igitare amazi aradudubiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.48.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 48:21"
          },
